            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Mucken is a traditional trick-taking card game using 24 or 32-card German, Bavarian, or Franconian pack for 4 players. It is a variation of Schafkopf with its own local simplifications and scoring.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Mucken is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym.',
